														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2683610">
									

<p>Written well enough, but this section didn't grab me at all, and is over rather quickly to leave any impression beyond two O5s squandering. My biggest issue is how -2 and -3 don't develop as characters here or show any sort of personality (and -2 hasn't blossomed yet compared to the wonderful characterization had in Harbinger, of a careful, determined yet nervous as shit Overseer). The only interesting thing here is how busy 089's been, but given how dire everything else has been, that maybe could have been intuited if someone had asked what 089 would be doing of all of this. Good for moving the plot along, though, and sometimes stories need just that.</p>

							</div>

								
					
